# Shock: chain lightning. The bolt grows ahead of the ship, seeks the nearest
# target in a forward 135-degree cone, and chains onward only from a KILLING
# hit — so a field of small breakable rocks makes it hop, and the tough one
# top-right stops it dead in a spark burst. That contrast is the clip.
# Pickup on the spawn selects it (Ship::add_shock); semi-automatic, so one
# `key space` per bolt.
seed 41
sim 500
frames 90
fps 30
size 960 540
clear
hud off
camera fixed
zoom 55
ship 0 0 0
pickup shock 0 0
# A staggered ladder, not a scatter: the bolt hops to the nearest target near
# its advancing tip, so tight alternating offsets make it visibly zigzag.
# Spread them wide and it just runs straight up through two of them.
asteroid -95 165 r=42
asteroid 85 255 r=40
asteroid -80 345 r=42
asteroid 100 430 r=40
asteroid -70 515 r=38
asteroid 250 155 r=40
asteroid -260 250 r=40
asteroid 330 480 tough r=85
key space 700
key space 1600
key space 2500
key space 3300
